{"id":205,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"立志・開拓・創作を掲げる小石川","feature_description":"小石川中等教育学校の教育理念は「立志・開拓・創作」です。教育課程では理数教育や国際理解教育に加え、6年間の探究学習「小石川フィロソフィー」を柱に、課題を見つけて考察し、成果をまとめ発表する学びを行います。教育理念をもとに教育課程を編成し、前期生と後期生が部活動を共にして経験を伝え合う環境も公式に紹介されています。これらを教育の柱として示しています。","clubs":[{"id":4566,"name":"競技かるた部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/koishikawa-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":4567,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/koishikawa-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":4568,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/koishikawa-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":4569,"name":"女子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/koishikawa-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":4570,"name":"華道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/koishikawa-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14596,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/koishikawa-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14597,"name":"ラグビー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/koishikawa-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14598,"name":"ソフトテニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/koishikawa-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14599,"name":"硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/koishikawa-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14600,"name":"軟式野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/koishikawa-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14601,"name":"男子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/koishikawa-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id"